WEBVTT

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:56.714
Arusu and the others were able to
protect the True Book from the warlocks.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:01:01.317
But Atelia tells them about the worst
possible situation regarding dark magic...

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:05.295
...and that light magic is only
mentioned in the Book of Prophecies.

00:01:05.599 --> 00:01:08.694
Plus Arusu finds out
about her dad and Atelia.

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:12.568
In other words, she finds out
that Lennon is her older brother.

00:01:13.607 --> 00:01:16.941
That must've been
very shocking for Arusu.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.868
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:59.868
Anguished Heart

00:03:02.816 --> 00:03:03.840
I'll never...

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.843
I'll never forgive you!

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:08.349
Lennon!

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:09.512
Stop it!

00:03:09.823 --> 00:03:11.086
Let go of me!

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:12.249
Calm down!

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:14.689
Let go of me!
You would never understand!

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:15.886
Let go of me!

00:03:15.996 --> 00:03:17.191
Let him go.

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.031
It's all right.

00:03:21.635 --> 00:03:25.367
No matter what reason I had,
| don't deserve to be forgiven.

00:03:28.008 --> 00:03:29.373
Lennon...

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.009
Stay still!

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.847
Close your eyes, everyone! Get down!

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:40.551
You won't hand over the book, and
now you want to revolt against Atelia?

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.212
We will arrest you!

00:03:45.492 --> 00:03:47.324
That's right! Arrest them!

00:03:48.528 --> 00:03:50.053
Don't touch me!

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:51.128
Lennon!

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:53.928
Don't tell me they were
after it from the beginning...

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:56.832
Stop! Let me go!

00:03:58.004 --> 00:03:59.995
We have to flee! Jump from the balcony!

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.801
Don't let them have the book!

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:03.569
Let go of me!

00:04:06.046 --> 00:04:07.070
This way!

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:08.678
Come back here!

00:04:08.882 --> 00:04:09.940
Take this!

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:17.890
Atelia!

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.749
Open up. Get me out of here.

00:04:43.483 --> 00:04:45.247
| want to see Tiana.

00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:51.517
| know a sure way of getting
the True Book of Spells.

00:05:01.668 --> 00:05:03.762
What is the current
status of the warlocks?

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:05.804
They seem calm right now.

00:05:05.905 --> 00:05:08.567
But we don't know when
they might strike again.

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:10.799
| understand.

00:05:12.345 --> 00:05:15.508
If only I had the True Book of Spells.

00:05:16.049 --> 00:05:18.677
I thought I could avoid
the warlock attack...

00:05:18.752 --> 00:05:21.380
...and protect those kids as well.

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:25.718
Also, we placed the Magical Girl Squad
on the wanted list for treason.

00:05:27.127 --> 00:05:29.892
It's only a matter of time
till they're caught.

00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:33.824
It's no good.
We're completely surrounded.

00:05:33.933 --> 00:05:36.095
We can't go back?

00:05:36.669 --> 00:05:40.435
No matter what they do,
this place will be destroyed. It's stupid.

00:05:41.975 --> 00:05:43.841
Do you understand?

00:05:44.878 --> 00:05:49.338
You must not hurt them.
| want you to protect them.

00:05:49.549 --> 00:05:52.177
Yes, hut, Atelia...
Why do you treat these...

00:05:52.285 --> 00:05:54.549
...apprentice witches
with such great care?

00:05:54.654 --> 00:05:56.452
And one more thing.

00:05:57.991 --> 00:06:01.791
You must not make the people feel
more uncomfortable than they are now.

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:06.259
Like the grand master,
my condition is getting worse.

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:09.028
Please act as discreetly as possible.

00:06:09.969 --> 00:06:12.131
Atelia collapsed?

00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:13.682
Should we go see her?

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:14.150
Should we go see her?
What for?

00:06:14.174 --> 00:06:15.369
What for?

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:17.776
There's no need to hit me.

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:19.355
This is a great chance for us!

00:06:19.379 --> 00:06:20.346
This is a great chance for us!
Yeah.

00:06:20.446 --> 00:06:24.610
This realm will be destroyed anyway.
I'm not afraid to do anything.

00:06:29.289 --> 00:06:31.587
I think we'll be safe here for a while.

00:06:31.658 --> 00:06:34.286
We're not safe!

00:06:34.661 --> 00:06:36.026
Where's Arusu?

00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:37.261
Well...

00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:43.461
She just found out she has a brother.

00:06:43.603 --> 00:06:46.595
Plus her brother happened to be Bucky.

00:06:46.906 --> 00:06:48.340
Sheila?

00:06:49.042 --> 00:06:51.136
Arusu has the True Book of Spells.

00:06:51.277 --> 00:06:52.403
Look after her.

00:06:52.879 --> 00:06:53.971
Not again!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.913
You never tell me where you're going!

00:06:59.419 --> 00:07:02.855
Mirror. So that's what you meant.

00:07:03.756 --> 00:07:05.383
| was surprised.

00:07:05.692 --> 00:07:09.629
| found out about you when I was
on the Interdimensional Sea, and...

00:07:10.964 --> 00:07:13.433
...that you had the True Book of Spells.

00:07:13.499 --> 00:07:15.024
So you called out to me?

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:17.695
| mean, that's what you call magic.

00:07:18.004 --> 00:07:20.905
No. I don't believe in magic.

00:07:23.543 --> 00:07:26.945
But now everything is going to end.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:30.342
After the destruction,
everything will be gone.

00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:35.049
Sorry for getting you
involved in all this.

00:07:43.263 --> 00:07:46.460
Leave the True Book of Spells
and step back.

00:07:47.567 --> 00:07:50.093
Otherwise, she wouldn't
have said that...

00:07:50.803 --> 00:07:54.364
Then Atelia must be the one
who can use dark magic...

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:09.044
The grand master is already resting
comfortably at the Fountain of Aeon.

00:08:09.656 --> 00:08:13.593
And now, Atelia has collapsed as well.

00:08:14.827 --> 00:08:17.990
It's safe to assume that our
system is already destroyed.

00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:22.226
In order to counter the warlocks,
now is the time to rise!

00:08:23.803 --> 00:08:25.100
Atelia collapsed?

00:08:25.571 --> 00:08:28.939
We can't just sit and
wait for the time of...

00:08:29.475 --> 00:08:32.968
...destruction without
fighting and kicking!

00:08:33.079 --> 00:08:34.478
We can't!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:38.448
Even if our bodies give way, we're
still going to fight till the very end!

00:08:38.551 --> 00:08:40.178
We're going to fight!

00:08:40.286 --> 00:08:44.052
We need to re-establish order
and fight the warlocks!

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.352
Fight the warlocks!

00:08:46.459 --> 00:08:49.485
We're going to establish
a new order by our hands!

00:08:49.595 --> 00:08:51.120
That's right!

00:08:54.133 --> 00:08:55.862
Forget about them.

00:08:56.135 --> 00:08:56.863
What?

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.566
It's going to be
destroyed anyway, right?

00:08:59.806 --> 00:09:01.706
Everything is going to perish.

00:09:01.808 --> 00:09:04.277
Then it doesn't matter
if you're good or bad.

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:06.505
There's nothing anyone can do about it.

00:09:06.612 --> 00:09:11.106
But if we let them do as they wish,
Nerabu and the others will get Atelia.

00:09:11.217 --> 00:09:13.914
Plus she can't even
use her magic right now.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:17.923
But we're wanted and being chased.

00:09:18.057 --> 00:09:21.152
That's right! We shouldn't be foolish
and get ourselves arrested...

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:22.750
Say whatever you want.

00:09:22.862 --> 00:09:26.856
You lived apart from your mother for
so long, and you finally got to meet her.

00:09:26.966 --> 00:09:28.491
Shouldn't you protect her?

00:09:28.601 --> 00:09:30.660
I told you.
| don't really care about her.

00:09:30.737 --> 00:09:33.172
Jeez. You can be very difficult.

00:09:33.373 --> 00:09:34.067
Whatever.

00:09:34.674 --> 00:09:35.903
Try this.

00:09:35.975 --> 00:09:38.053
This is no time to be eating that stuff.

00:09:38.077 --> 00:09:39.288
This is no time to be eating that stuff.
Just do as I say and eat it.

00:09:39.312 --> 00:09:40.404
Just do as I say and eat it.

00:09:43.983 --> 00:09:45.348
It's delicious, right?

00:09:45.485 --> 00:09:46.975
So what?

00:09:47.086 --> 00:09:51.648
I'm saying, "Who do you thank for
this chestnut being delicious?"

00:09:53.226 --> 00:09:56.059
You were all alone, and you probably...

00:09:56.162 --> 00:09:58.426
...went through tough times
in the past...

00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:00.560
...but if she wasn't here...

00:10:00.767 --> 00:10:02.895
If you weren't born from her...

00:10:03.036 --> 00:10:06.836
...you wouldn't have been able
to taste that delicious chestnut.

00:10:07.607 --> 00:10:09.735
She's your mother, Lennon!

00:10:12.612 --> 00:10:14.512
Hey, Lennon! Over here!

00:10:16.416 --> 00:10:17.212
Come here!

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.179
She's your mother!

00:10:24.924 --> 00:10:25.686
Arusu.

00:10:26.459 --> 00:10:29.861
With everything in chaos...
How come you're feeling optimistic?

00:10:30.496 --> 00:10:31.486
You see...

00:10:32.732 --> 00:10:35.793
| want to protect both of you...
| mean, everyone...

00:10:35.902 --> 00:10:38.667
...from the destruction
with the miracle of magic.

00:10:38.771 --> 00:10:41.502
I thought light magic
was needed for that...

00:10:41.607 --> 00:10:43.666
But I went through a lot, and...

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:47.444
...didn't know why I was here
and for what purpose.

00:10:47.613 --> 00:10:50.583
| couldn't tell what I wanted to do.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:54.377
But there's nothing
| can do just by thinking.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:57.781
If I just wanted someone
to be happy, I realized...

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.291
...that my body just acts on its own.

00:11:00.426 --> 00:11:02.986
So I thought,
I'll just leave it that way...

00:11:06.032 --> 00:11:07.363
What is going on?

00:11:07.733 --> 00:11:09.929
The people are attacking!

00:11:15.875 --> 00:11:17.639
It's coming to an end!

00:11:18.344 --> 00:11:22.281
The witch tradition that you've
been trying to protect all this time.

00:11:33.392 --> 00:11:36.384
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.933 --> 00:11:45.393
The One Thing That
Must Be Protected

00:11:48.941 --> 00:11:51.239
Jidan? You mean that man?

00:11:51.477 --> 00:11:52.444
That's right.

00:11:52.645 --> 00:11:55.114
The human male that
I'm being held captive with.

00:11:56.649 --> 00:11:58.708
He's Arusu's father.

00:11:59.452 --> 00:12:03.252
He's Arusu's father,
and he had the True Book of Spells.

00:12:04.357 --> 00:12:07.224
So if we tell them that
we're keeping him hostage...

00:12:07.326 --> 00:12:09.090
...they'll definitely come here.

00:12:09.495 --> 00:12:13.762
They'll exchange the True Book of Spells
in order to save Arusu's father.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.090
Tiana!

00:12:15.434 --> 00:12:17.766
You came here just in time. We'll...

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:21.135
Something unusual is going on
in the Witch Realm!

00:12:21.307 --> 00:12:24.743
Members of the special task force
are leading the witches.

00:12:24.877 --> 00:12:27.107
Plus they marched to Dragon Palatium...

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.410
...and are trying to occupy the place.

00:12:33.686 --> 00:12:35.154
What is all this?

00:12:37.156 --> 00:12:39.250
This is bad! We're on the wanted list!

00:12:39.358 --> 00:12:40.951
We'll get arrested!

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.154
This has nothing to do with us anymore!

00:12:43.262 --> 00:12:44.661
We're going to flee!

00:12:46.499 --> 00:12:47.432
It's fear.

00:12:47.633 --> 00:12:48.429
Fear?

00:12:49.035 --> 00:12:53.563
Destruction of the Magical Realm.
Plus the thought of them dying.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:57.776
They don't know what to do with their fear,
so it came out in this form.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:00.106
But what can they achieve by doing this?

00:13:00.213 --> 00:13:05.174
They're all thinking about themselves.
That's why they hate each other!

00:13:05.284 --> 00:13:08.481
| can't believe you still
say things like that! We're...

00:13:08.588 --> 00:13:12.183
If you like them that much, then
you should keep doing what you do.

00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:16.751
We're not born to hate other people!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:18.196
Hey!

00:13:18.364 --> 00:13:19.195
Arusu!

00:13:20.199 --> 00:13:21.325
Arusu!

00:13:29.875 --> 00:13:31.900
Hey, come on!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.880
Now I will have my men
tell this Arusu that we have...

00:13:37.984 --> 00:13:41.818
...her father locked up, and
if she wants him back alive...

00:13:41.921 --> 00:13:45.152
...then she'll have to give us
the True Book of Spells.

00:13:45.258 --> 00:13:46.248
Goodbye.

00:13:46.559 --> 00:13:49.358
Then let me do that job.
Get me out of here...

00:13:53.299 --> 00:13:55.461
You still don't get it, do you?

00:13:55.735 --> 00:14:01.105
Those who betray our trust
will never be trusted again!

00:14:10.249 --> 00:14:11.593
From the look of things, maybe...

00:14:11.617 --> 00:14:12.641
From the look of things, maybe...
We're almost there.

00:14:12.718 --> 00:14:15.688
Sorry, but I have to get rid of them!
Take this!

00:14:21.594 --> 00:14:23.119
Where's Atelia?

00:14:30.236 --> 00:14:31.533
She's still breathing!

00:14:31.604 --> 00:14:32.230
Eva!

00:14:32.338 --> 00:14:33.271
Okay!

00:14:34.674 --> 00:14:36.403
Um... there!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.244
A-Atelia is...

00:14:45.518 --> 00:14:47.145
It's coming to an end!

00:14:47.253 --> 00:14:51.156
The witch tradition that you've
been trying to protect all this time.

00:14:51.757 --> 00:14:55.921
We already know that
your powers are getting weaker.

00:14:57.496 --> 00:15:01.660
We're not afraid of you
since you have no power!

00:15:05.271 --> 00:15:06.067
What?

00:15:10.076 --> 00:15:14.445
Atelia probably went
to see the grand master.

00:15:18.984 --> 00:15:21.180
This scenery doesn't suit us.

00:15:24.123 --> 00:15:25.454
Save that for later.

00:15:25.624 --> 00:15:29.959
If we capture Atelia, then
we can do whatever we want!

00:15:30.363 --> 00:15:31.262
Let's go!

00:15:33.065 --> 00:15:34.464
Atelia!

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.711
Where are you, Atelia?

00:15:35.735 --> 00:15:36.702
Where are you, Atelia?
Come on out!

00:15:36.802 --> 00:15:37.462
Damn!

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:41.966
She's in here.

00:15:56.288 --> 00:15:57.915
This is terrible...

00:15:58.591 --> 00:16:00.958
If we're ruled by people like them...

00:16:01.193 --> 00:16:03.628
| wonder if she's okay.
Hey, come on.

00:16:03.729 --> 00:16:04.662
Hurry!

00:16:08.901 --> 00:16:10.892
Hold it right there, Atelia!

00:16:12.138 --> 00:16:16.006
We never liked you! Ever since
we were apprentice witches!

00:16:16.509 --> 00:16:19.035
You were a goody two-shoes
who could do everything.

00:16:19.145 --> 00:16:22.342
You ignored us since we were all rowdy!

00:16:22.448 --> 00:16:24.883
What is wrong with that?

00:16:25.251 --> 00:16:26.184
Everything!

00:16:46.939 --> 00:16:48.031
We did it!

00:16:48.774 --> 00:16:49.935
You people!

00:16:50.042 --> 00:16:51.339
You bastards!

00:16:53.679 --> 00:16:59.015
Well, you see, Lennon really
wanted to help his mother, so...

00:16:59.118 --> 00:17:00.779
| never said that!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.646
You people should not be here.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:09.059
The three of you might be
apprentice witches, but Lennon is not.

00:17:10.162 --> 00:17:13.223
You certainly know
what you're talking about...

00:17:13.399 --> 00:17:16.369
This fight is between us and Atelia!

00:17:16.635 --> 00:17:19.798
This is no place for little kids
like yourselves to be...

00:17:19.972 --> 00:17:23.465
As the grand master's successor,
| am responsible...

00:17:23.609 --> 00:17:25.873
...for protecting the magic.

00:17:26.479 --> 00:17:29.107
Even if that means putting
my life on the line.

00:17:29.215 --> 00:17:32.446
That's right. I gave you up
in order to protect the magic.

00:17:32.551 --> 00:17:34.349
It is my duty.

00:17:35.654 --> 00:17:36.917
You see that?

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.058
She's not my mother!

00:17:40.826 --> 00:17:41.554
Lennon!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.526
Eva! Go after Lennon!

00:17:44.396 --> 00:17:47.195
Anyway, let's try to save everyone.

00:17:47.366 --> 00:17:49.391
You people should flee as well.

00:17:50.636 --> 00:17:53.298
You let Lennon escape?

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:57.799
Soon, people are probably
going to occupy this place.

00:17:58.511 --> 00:18:00.206
What about you, Atelia?

00:18:00.379 --> 00:18:03.872
| still have a place to protect.

00:18:05.451 --> 00:18:06.612
Let's go, Arusu!

00:18:06.719 --> 00:18:08.346
We're going with Atelia!

00:18:12.091 --> 00:18:13.855
It feels different...

00:18:14.894 --> 00:18:16.726
Different? What do you mean?

00:18:16.829 --> 00:18:19.799
| don't know what it is,
but it feels different.

00:18:23.435 --> 00:18:27.394
But you're the one who said
that magic needs to be protected.

00:18:27.506 --> 00:18:29.235
You're right, but...

00:18:29.942 --> 00:18:33.401
That's why it feels much
different than usual.

00:18:43.989 --> 00:18:45.457
You're Arusu?

00:18:47.426 --> 00:18:48.655
Come with us!

00:18:49.795 --> 00:18:50.853
Let me go!

00:18:55.568 --> 00:18:57.332
What are you doing?

00:18:58.103 --> 00:18:58.661
Stop it!

00:18:58.904 --> 00:19:02.704
Fairies should've been free
from the very beginning!

00:19:03.008 --> 00:19:04.100
Arusu!

00:19:05.411 --> 00:19:06.742
It's Lennon!

00:19:06.946 --> 00:19:09.745
Lennon was taken away by the warlocks!

00:19:10.583 --> 00:19:11.812
Lennon?

00:19:12.685 --> 00:19:13.652
Atelia!

00:19:15.421 --> 00:19:18.083
| have made many sacrifices in my life...

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:21.125
...and I chose the path
of becoming a sage.

00:19:22.094 --> 00:19:26.031
Witches have protected their
tradition for a very long time.

00:19:26.131 --> 00:19:29.499
| cannot break that tradition
by saving my son!

00:19:29.602 --> 00:19:31.969
Who cares about tradition!

00:19:33.205 --> 00:19:36.072
Even if you try hard to protect
the tradition of magic...

00:19:36.609 --> 00:19:40.204
If you don't try to protect
the ones you love with magic...

00:19:40.312 --> 00:19:43.282
...then there's no point
in protecting tradition!

00:19:43.382 --> 00:19:46.147
Magic that you can use
to protect your friends...

00:19:46.251 --> 00:19:48.913
...family, and other important people...

00:19:50.155 --> 00:19:54.353
Isn't that what you'd
really call protecting magic?

00:19:56.595 --> 00:19:59.326
Those who can't protect
their loved ones...

00:20:00.099 --> 00:20:02.864
How could you protect magic
if you don't...

00:20:02.968 --> 00:20:05.835
...even have the intention
of making others happy!

00:20:17.816 --> 00:20:25.780
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.958 --> 00:20:33.958
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:43.200
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:49.974
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:50.082 --> 00:20:54.349
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:55.087 --> 00:20:59.320
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:59.425 --> 00:21:04.022
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:04.229 --> 00:21:09.395
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.501 --> 00:21:12.562
Let's hope it does.

00:21:14.139 --> 00:21:18.633
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.744 --> 00:21:21.236
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:21.346 --> 00:21:29.346
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.556 --> 00:21:36.256
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:36.361 --> 00:21:40.559
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
